</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>7<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>Невидимые
пятна на
солнце,
какая-то пыль
на траве.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           
</span></span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>7<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>C</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>6/</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>h</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>Счастье
не греет; оно
где-то за
стеклянной
стеной.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    
</span>G/f<span class="GramE">#<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>Em</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span>C G6/h Am<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span>G D<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Иногда
мне кажется -
тяжёлый рок
висит надо
мной.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>: G G/f# Em C G6/h Am G D<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Я пошёл
к цыганке -
узнать о
своей судьбе:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Не
вредно ли
думать так
много,
причём, в основном,
о тебе.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Она
бросила
карты на пол,
закрыла
глаза рукой<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И
сказала:
"Бриллиантовый
мой, тяжёлый
рок висит над
тобой<span class="GramE">."</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>: G G/f# Em C G6/h Am G D – 2p.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Всё
лишилось
смысла.
Любовь
завела меня в
тень<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>А чем
выше
залезаешь в <span class="SpellE">астрал</span>,
тем больше
несёшь
дребедень<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Просто
хотелось
вечного лета,
а лето стало зимой<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span>G/f#<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span>Em<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span>C G6/h <span class="GramE">Am<span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> 
</span>G</span> <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>То ли
это рок, то ли
законы
